### 获取图形验证码
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/captchaImage

### 登录（默认账号 admin / admin123，密码由 system.seed 初始化）
# @name login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 登录（带验证码，CAPTCHA_ENABLED=true 时使用）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123",
  "code": "1234",
  "uuid": "验证码标识"
}

### 获取登录用户信息（令牌取自登录响应）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/getInfo
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 获取前端路由
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/getRouters
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 退出登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 未携带令牌访问业务接口（预期 401）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user/list?pageSize=1

### 携带令牌访问业务接口
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/system/user/list?pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
